<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Impact(I) -->\n∃ O, Exp, V, P, G. (PhysicalEndurant(O) ∨ EcosystemService(O)), Exposure(Exp), Vulnerability(V), ThreatPerdurant(P), Goal(G)\ninheresIn(V, O), manifestedBy(V, P), refersTo(V, G),\nexposedElement(Exp, O), exposedTo(Exp, P),\nintendedGoal(O, G),\nimpactsOn(I, O), refersTo(I, G), dpo:dependsOn(I, V), dpo:dependsOn(I, Exp), dpo:resultOf(I, P) ." .
