<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#participantOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "participantOf(E, P) --> \n∃ G, G1, T, T1. ThreatPerdurant(P),\nhasGeometry(E, G), hasTime(E, T), hasGeometry(P, G1), hasTime(P, T1),\ngeo:sfIntersect(G, G1), time:notDisjoint(T, T1) .\n\nparticipantOf(E, P) --> (EcosystemService(E) ∨ PhysicalEndurant(E)), ThreatPerdurant(P)" .
